===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The top [[surface]] of a desk.
# {{lb|en|computing}} A [[desktop computer]].
#: ''Laptops are often more expensive than '''desktops'''.''
# {{lb|en|computing|GUI}} The main [[graphical user interface]] of an [[operating system]], usually displaying [[icon]]s, [[window]]s and background [[wallpaper]].
#: ''I installed a new application and it added its icon to my '''desktop'''.''

